{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Stephen had a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83afc7db05a98f454fe0288fe07e680638df2c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:00 \\text{a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> appointment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km from his home. He averaged <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km/h for the trip and arrived <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes late for the appointment. At what time did he leave his home?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58b7e18281dbffbe592d4f7191dd6ee5f0b4c71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 9:35 \\text{a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 9:15 \\text{a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8:40 \\text{a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 9:00 \\text{a.m.} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 9:20 \\text{a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"711\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the appointment was supposed to be at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f47b8281adebaee3df2478a9229035d042e7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> a.m. but he was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes late, then he arrived there at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8da3ffe8af46d91ed1dda233006a1c02caf442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> a.m.\n</p><p>Converting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km/h into km/m, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a15a1629d0753d6c1f1752f2f31be689a2f597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 \\div 60 = \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> km/m.\n</p><p>This means that the time taken to get to the appointment was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7db600028649cf351709d0e7baafebe9f7b2dcb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\div \\frac{4}{3} = 60 \\times \\frac{3}{4} = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\" /> minutes.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes before <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8da3ffe8af46d91ed1dda233006a1c02caf442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> a.m. is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/b/15b014f97e7c09c9f6072beed14aec45df0f4708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 9:35 \\text{a.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(answer_choices)\">Solution 2 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the appointment was supposed to be at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f47b8281adebaee3df2478a9229035d042e7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> a.m. but he was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes late, then he arrived there at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8da3ffe8af46d91ed1dda233006a1c02caf442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> a.m.\n</p><p>Since the appointment was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km from his house but he was going at a speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km/h, he must have gotten there in less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km.\n</p><p>The only answer choice where Stephen would have got there in less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/b/15b014f97e7c09c9f6072beed14aec45df0f4708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 9:35 \\text{a.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8